# Only the Vite web app should be deployed to Vercel. This is a monorepo, and
# the CLI uploads every non-ignored file — which previously dragged in ~200MB of
# APKs, 100s of unicode/space-named doc files and a stray video, causing Vercel's
# upload API to 500 ("Internal Server Error" -> "Upload aborted").
#
# NOTE: when a .vercelignore exists, Vercel does NOT fall back to .gitignore, so
# the heavy dirs must be listed here explicitly.

# Dependencies & build output (regenerated by Vercel's remote build)
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vercel/
*.log

# IDE / agent / generated docs — never part of the site (unicode + space names)
.qoder/
.agents/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Sibling apps in this monorepo (deployed independently: EAS / other hosts)
axx-spaces-mobile/
axxspace-admin/

# Runtime uploads served by the backend API, not this static site
uploads/

# Local-only / stray files
*.local
0
index.html.save
react
react-router-dom
